# The shop needs NO environment variables or secrets to run.
# Store name, colours, contacts, Telegram token and every other setting live
# in the D1 database and are edited in the admin panel (/admin).
#
# This file is only for deploying from a terminal or CI WITHOUT `npx wrangler login`.
# Copy it to `.env` (never commit `.env`); Wrangler reads it automatically.
#
# API token: Cloudflare dashboard → My Profile → API Tokens → Create Token →
# template "Edit Cloudflare Workers", plus D1:Edit permission.
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
#
# Account ID: Cloudflare dashboard → Workers & Pages → right sidebar.
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
